{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"62ea2ed9e59480f471ddfa3f4f6531ffa78705c178557eb9afcca017da321c2f","ja":"……今日は私たちのイベントにお越しくださり、\nありがとうございました！","zh":"……非常感谢各位今天\n前来参加我们的活动！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7b9397bb8b0697629870a6d61440ec12cb2b131cf464518a62199b0c574f6e58","ja":"ワアアアアーーーッ！！！","zh":"哇啊啊啊啊——！！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1dbbba94cc1372465d0e7dc775f14891980a7c46b75e8b5d73d44b72c1769cf2","ja":"遊園地のイベントって、\n子どももたくさんいて、すっごく楽しいね！","zh":"游乐园的活动现场\n有好多小孩子，真的好开心呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"fdbcdb9833d6d74b63b4a3cba87f0d0a65d7fff7bd4e8952f0628b8891584989","ja":"うん、みんないっぱい盛り上がってくれて、\n私たちのほうが元気をもらっちゃったみたい♪","zh":"嗯，大家都很捧场，\n反倒是我们从大家那里获得了活力呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"4a6c28bcff05530fba76430eeb095f95217b3f77f75827ebf18eff19afecfeb0","ja":"あれ？　志保ちゃん、どうしたの？","zh":"哎？志保，怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f6e86adc8805edbb50bc2efee2d7c74457400380e89f5f93d8750f4ee6927d83","ja":"あ、すみません。その……「まだ帰りたくない」って\n言ってた男の子が気になって。","zh":"啊，不好意思。那个……我有点在意\n刚才说“还不想回去”的那个男孩子。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b4f138d99da9fb5212d484cfd72b507dc22f66716ea0a35bf2f5ff1d98b13b4f","ja":"あっ、最後まで残ってた子だよね。\nお母さん、困っちゃってたな……。","zh":"啊，是留到最后那个孩子吧。\n妈妈看起来挺为难的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"430cb0239fb31b2468b48db0a31285186b9fcfa07a769bfe5d05c33642372ea6","ja":"弟と歳が近そうだからでしょうか……それで、\n弟と公園に行くときのことを思い出してしまって。","zh":"可能是因为年纪跟我弟弟差不多吧……所以，\n我就不由得想起了和弟弟去公园时的事情。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b72d648bb34b2266ccedb515235deb39ef218fab971f0118fcd7645c3d87a646","ja":"暗くなったら帰ろうって言ってるんですけど、\nなんだか最近、遊び足りないみたいで……。","zh":"虽然跟他说天黑了就回家，\n但最近总觉得他好像还没玩够似的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"3e8ef918e1073d264bc8f55afcad94749765ae0d40f09581e096deacbd49b312","ja":"そっか……この時期、まだ日が暮れるの早いもんね。\nあっという間に感じちゃうのかな？","zh":"这样啊……这个时期，太阳落山还挺早的呢。\n所以才会觉得时间过得一转眼就没了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"c830bcab9d55e03594fe00fea3c22493fd476a030f829b6abab560cbce2ce490","ja":"そうだね。だからといって、暗くなってからも\n遊ぶのは、やっぱり危ないし……。","zh":"也是呢。但话虽如此，天黑之后\n还在外面玩，果然还是很危险的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1149.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"bd7b9b375ce58cab15830521ce108c3cf5c3158c59541b593063966bc7aa8b98","ja":"はい。どうしたものかと……。","zh":"是的。不知道该怎么办才好……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
